---
import Shell from '../../../../../components/AeroEvidenceShell.astro';
import status from '../../../../../../public/demos/aero/blind-validation-01-run-v1/current-status.json';
---
<Shell title="Aero · Benchmarks" description="External CFD comparisons and local-model operator trials, with their distinct evidence boundaries." path="/software/aero/evidence/benchmarks/">
  <header>
    <p class="eyebrow">AERO / BENCHMARK REGISTER</p>
    <h1>What was tested, and what did it prove?</h1>
    <p>External measurements test physical predictions. Local-model trials test guarded workflow behavior. These are separate claims.</p>
  </header>
  <section class="cards">
    <article>
      <p class="eyebrow">THERMAL SYSTEMS / PROGRAM REPORT</p>
      <span class="status mixed">EVIDENCE RELEASE · VALIDATION INCOMPLETE</span>
      <h2>Heat-exchanger benchmark program</h2>
      <p>HX-S01 is a source-informed synthetic CHT study that failed its frozen numerical gates. HX-B01 adds a separately disclosed analytical correlation comparison that failed by 30.86%, and five synthetic companions exercise coupling, fidelity, sensitivity, trade and transfer paths. Blind and structural candidates remain source-gated; no experimental accuracy, structural accuracy, or design readiness is claimed.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="/software/aero/evidence/benchmarks/heat-exchanger-benchmark-program-v1/">Read program status and evidence</a></div>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p class="eyebrow">EXTERNAL CFD / CHALLENGE 01</p>
      <span class:list={['status',status.result==='FAIL'?'failed':'pending']}>{status.result}</span>
      <h2>Blind Validation Challenge 01</h2>
      <p>NASA TM-4074 Table XIII: 18 angles × 3 grids. Frozen criteria and input-only execution code preceded the production runs. {status.completed} / {status.total} attempts finished in the published snapshot. Reference-withheld execution; supervisory setup was not fully blinded.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="/software/aero/evidence/benchmarks/blind-validation-01/">Read protocol and chronology →</a></div>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p class="eyebrow">LOCAL-MODEL / OPERATOR HANDOFF</p>
      <span class="status mixed">MIXED</span>
      <h2>Model-to-CFD workflow trials</h2>
      <p>Seven iterative airfoil attempts and the internal-flow model trials are retained, including rejected proposals. A local 7B model completed a solver run with operator help but failed strict observation; two bounded 14B workflows passed.</p>
      <p class="subtle">This tests proposal and evidence-reading behavior, not agreement with independent CFD measurements.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="/software/aero/evidence/benchmarks/model-operator/">Read every operator-trial outcome →</a></div>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p class="eyebrow">THERMAL + STRUCTURAL / SOURCE-DERIVED</p>
      <span class="status mixed">SYNTHETIC PREBENCHMARK</span>
      <h2>Samarmad-derived PCHE gate pack</h2>
      <p>A separate six-point synthetic shakedown of prediction freeze, criteria hashing, curved-interface transfer, generic OpenFOAM CHT, and generic CalculiX gates.</p>
      <p class="subtle">Synthetic pipeline proof only; not the publication-specific run.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="/software/aero/evidence/benchmarks/samarmad-synthetic/">Inspect the prebenchmark record →</a></div>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p class="eyebrow">THERMAL-HYDRAULIC / PUBLICATION-TARGETED</p>
      <span class="status failed">NUMERICAL FAIL · EXPERIMENT UNSCORED</span>
      <h2>Samarmad PCHE v1 — independent reconstruction</h2>
      <p>Three OpenFOAM CHT grids ran on the reconstructed Model 6 cell. Every grid misses the residual target, and medium-to-fine pressure drop shifts by more than 22%. The article was reviewed after freeze, but no exact matching experimental point could be established; v1 is not tuned.</p>
      <p class="subtle">The paper has no structural test. Exploratory CalculiX mapping failed its 100% coverage gate. The prediction hash is verified; external timestamp confirmation remains pending.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="/software/aero/evidence/benchmarks/samarmad-pche-publication-v1/">Read the run and post-reveal disposition →</a></div>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p class="eyebrow">THERMAL-HYDRAULIC / SOURCE-INFORMED SYNTHETIC</p>
      <span class="status failed">NUMERICAL FAIL · EXPERIMENT NOT SCORED</span>
      <h2>HX-S01 — reconstructed counterflow PCHE</h2>
      <p>A disclosed, source-informed replacement tests first-principles screening and three-grid OpenFOAM CHT after the publication path could not establish a matched pointwise experimental target. Missing inputs are explicit assumptions; no invented measurements are treated as truth.</p>
      <p class="subtle">The frozen 250-iteration baseline remains failed. Same-settings continuations are diagnostic only and cannot retroactively pass it.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="/software/aero/evidence/benchmarks/heat-exchanger-program-v1/">Read the synthetic study and evidence →</a></div>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p class="eyebrow">CFD / FAILURE INVESTIGATION · HARCC S4 PART II</p>
      <span class="status failed">NUMERICAL FAIL · INVESTIGATION COMPLETE</span>
      <h2>HARCC S4 methane cooling: solver-control investigation</h2>
      <p>A frozen v5 residual failure was investigated with bounded pressure-cap and outer-corrector comparisons. A setup mistake is explicitly excluded; the corrected treatment moves two target residuals down and one up. All target gates remain failed.</p>
      <p class="subtle">Reference-withheld initial model diagnosis; sequential follow-ups. No matched experimental validation, mesh independence or design readiness is claimed.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="/software/aero/evidence/benchmarks/harcc-s4-part2/">Read Part II and inspect retained logs →</a></div>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p class="eyebrow">MODEL-BEHAVIOR / FRESH-CONTEXT COMPARISON</p>
      <span class="status mixed">COMPLETE · NO SOLVER RUN</span>
      <h2>HARCC S4: Luna versus Sol investigator diagnosis</h2>
      <p>Two models independently inspected the same frozen v5 failure packet with later experiments and publication results withheld. Luna scored 17/18 and Sol-light 16/18 on the predeclared evidence-discipline rubric.</p>
      <p class="subtle">This compares bounded investigation behavior on one case. It is not a model-ranking claim and adds no CFD validation.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="/software/aero/evidence/benchmarks/harcc-s4-sol-comparison/">Read the paired scorecard and frozen Sol response →</a></div>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p class="eyebrow">CONTEXT EFFICIENCY / MODEL-BEHAVIOR QUALIFICATION</p>
      <span class="status mixed">INFRASTRUCTURE PASS · MODEL QUALIFICATION OPEN</span>
      <h2>CEP-01 — context, routing &amp; portability</h2>
      <p>Revision 1.5 separates six claims—reporting, telemetry narration, engineering explanation, context compression, routing/escalation, and investigation routing—and compares full versus progressive context across seven retained evidence states.</p>
      <p class="subtle">The fixture harness records 42 comparisons and a 93.82% mean estimated payload reduction. It makes no universal model verdict and does not replace CFD/FEA evidence.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="/software/aero/evidence/benchmarks/context-efficiency-cep01/">Read the report and inspect results →</a></div>
      <span class="status mixed">SYNTHETIC STUDY · EXPERIMENT NOT SCORED</span>
      <h2>HX-S01 — reconstructed counterflow PCHE</h2>
      <p>A disclosed, source-informed replacement tests first-principles screening and three-grid OpenFOAM CHT where the publication path could not establish a matched pointwise experimental target. Missing inputs are explicit assumptions; no invented measurements are treated as truth.</p>
      <p class="subtle">The failed 250-iteration baseline remains frozen. Same-settings continuations are reported separately and cannot retroactively pass it.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="/software/aero/evidence/benchmarks/heat-exchanger-program-v1/">Read the synthetic study and evidence →</a></div>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p class="eyebrow">THERMAL-HYDRAULIC / BLIND INVESTIGATOR</p>
      <span class="status failed">BLOCKED PENDING PROPERTY RUNTIME</span>
      <h2>HX-02B — sodium / supercritical-CO₂ PCHE</h2>
      <p>GPT-5.6 Luna received only the frozen visible packet and chose an analytical-only path. The operating point, idealized measurement planes, and active-area convention are now explicit; the independent supercritical-CO2 property runtime is the remaining gate.</p>
      <p class="subtle">No solver was dispatched and the sealed experimental truth was not revealed. This is a property-runtime stop, not a solver failure.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="/software/aero/evidence/benchmarks/hx-02b/">Read the blind handoff status →</a></div>
    </article>
  </section>
  <section><h2>Register policy</h2><p>Each future CFD, thermal or structural benchmark receives a versioned entry, source citation, frozen criteria, outcome, and comparison history. Failed and incomplete trials remain listed. Workflow scores are not presented as physical-validation scores.</p><a href="/software/aero/evidence/">Return to all evidence →</a></section>
</Shell>
